{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43479","headline":"空水共澄鲜 · 无名氏","name":"空水共澄鲜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠然四望通，渺渺水无穷。\n海鹤飞天际，烟林出镜中。\n云消澄徧碧，霞起澹微红。\n落日浮光满，遥山翠色同。\n樵声喧竹屿，櫂唱入莲藂。\n远客舟中兴，烦襟暂一空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43479.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43479","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}